    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d147">

                <pb facs="0330" n="242" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg242"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/2749: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Chile</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Norweb</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-01-06T18:00:00-04:00">January 6, 1933—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received January 6—5:35 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6. My telegram number 4, January 4, 9 p.m. After my third conversation there is
                    no indication that the Foreign Minister<anchor n="9" xml:id="d147-f1"/> has <pb
                        facs="0331" n="243" xml:id="pg243"/> been active in advancing any proposal,
                    that he has made any tangible progress or that he has revealed to anyone what
                    ideas he may have.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Norweb</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d147-f1" n="9" xml:id="d147-f1-content">
                <p>Miguel Cruchaga Tocornal.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
